WEBVTT

00:01.060 --> 00:02.360
Big trouble, Kimaki!

00:02.600 --> 00:04.650
And Sir Thundering Voice's party!

00:08.360 --> 00:13.240
The Guren Nairi that attacked 
yesterday is still outside, waiting!

00:20.030 --> 00:23.000
For warriors and knights like us...

00:23.340 --> 00:25.700
Fighting on the front line...

00:26.980 --> 00:28.770
is where we are most powerful!

00:35.120 --> 00:37.270
Have the others back down!

00:37.270 --> 00:40.320
Miss Sera! 
The backup hunters are in position.

00:40.320 --> 00:43.560
Tell our comrades not to 
worry about friendly fire.

00:44.800 --> 00:46.030
The pressure of this willpower...

00:51.750 --> 00:52.530
It's coming!

01:25.980 --> 01:33.570
The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King

02:41.840 --> 02:45.770
No follow up attack... 
it's sizing me up.

02:46.700 --> 02:49.400
How very shrewd, for a dragon.

03:00.060 --> 03:03.690
Veor must've neutralized 
its flame breath!

03:05.040 --> 03:08.040
No. It's still got a slight edge!

03:08.740 --> 03:12.830
If it wasn't for the Silver Flower, 
I would've at least been injured.

03:13.700 --> 03:14.540
Sera!

03:15.320 --> 03:17.960
I won't guess at what it's after,

03:17.960 --> 03:21.030
but coming to ground is an opportunity 
for us! We need to attack!

03:21.030 --> 03:24.230
You're right. If it goes airborne 
again, we'll be at a disadvantage.

03:31.100 --> 03:34.110
So hard! The pressure from its 
willpower is unlike anything else!

03:34.110 --> 03:37.130
My own willpower channeled through 
my weapon is nearly neutralized!

03:44.080 --> 03:44.970
Sera!

04:09.310 --> 04:11.060
Let's bring it down, Sera!

04:22.570 --> 04:24.910
It's got a typical quadruped's agility!

04:25.290 --> 04:27.900
Even the gaps between its 
scales don't feel vulnerable.

04:27.900 --> 04:30.430
This is likely to turn into a 
battle of willpower attrition!

04:40.830 --> 04:42.360
Master Veor...

04:42.360 --> 04:44.100
Lady Serafina...

04:44.100 --> 04:45.430
They're struggling!

04:45.760 --> 04:50.550
I-Is that thing really on the level of 
the Morisuberi they hunted the other day?

04:50.550 --> 04:54.180
I-I don't know how you expect me to know!

04:54.180 --> 04:56.450
I-If I only I had my scripture...

04:56.790 --> 05:00.680
I see. Looks like it's time 
to put that into action!

05:01.630 --> 05:05.630
I had a feeling it'd come to 
this, so I stayed up late...

05:05.630 --> 05:08.580
making this chain detonation dragon bomb!

05:11.850 --> 05:15.590
Dwarf girl! I won't have you blowing 
them up along with the beast!

05:15.590 --> 05:19.880
The flash grenade from the other 
day barely had any effect!

05:19.880 --> 05:23.100
And remember what she said 
about friendly fire?!

05:23.100 --> 05:24.870
Be that as it may, there are limits!

05:24.870 --> 05:27.100
I get the feeling you just 
want to test this contraption!

05:27.100 --> 05:29.310
Put it down!

05:34.460 --> 05:37.640
Well, I have to throw it now!

05:38.570 --> 05:41.570
Look out! I'm tossing a bomb!

05:41.570 --> 05:43.570
Seven... six...

05:43.900 --> 05:45.570
Five... four...

05:45.980 --> 05:48.150
Three... two...

05:48.150 --> 05:49.700
One!

05:56.500 --> 05:57.700
Did it work?!

06:04.950 --> 06:06.720
Master Veor!

06:04.950 --> 06:06.720
Lady Serafina!

06:07.270 --> 06:09.970
Stands to reason the blast 
wouldn't have much effect

06:09.970 --> 06:11.670
with no willpower behind it.

06:11.670 --> 06:14.330
I knew that was gonna happen, 
but still don't like the result!

06:16.250 --> 06:17.790
It's looking this way!

06:16.660 --> 06:18.770
Not good, not good!

06:17.790 --> 06:19.770
We're toast!

06:19.770 --> 06:20.900
Well done!

06:21.900 --> 06:24.380
You let me catch my breath, Kimaki!

06:36.780 --> 06:37.740
It's stunned!

06:38.080 --> 06:40.130
The pressure is gone! 
I must strike now!

06:47.990 --> 06:49.100
It was able to defend!

06:49.710 --> 06:52.420
Did it realize the battle was 
lost if I reached its head?!

07:00.030 --> 07:01.020
Sera!

07:01.310 --> 07:04.130
I'm sorry, Veor. I couldn't finish it!

07:10.840 --> 07:12.910
Not good... It's in the air.

07:17.180 --> 07:18.290
Veor!

07:19.770 --> 07:22.800
Between my armor and my voice, 
that won't be enough to kill me.

07:23.120 --> 07:27.050
You can't be unharmed after being 
blasted with willpower-enhanced flames!

07:27.050 --> 07:30.050
I can withstand it better than 
you can in that steel armor!

07:44.590 --> 07:47.050
You rang, and I came, Red!

07:47.050 --> 07:50.190
I haven't heard from you in an age!

07:54.830 --> 07:57.390
Lady Vyufmec?!

08:10.600 --> 08:12.510
Lady Vyufmec...

08:14.600 --> 08:16.440
What's the fairy doing here?

08:16.440 --> 08:18.350
I couldn't tell you, either.

08:18.640 --> 08:23.360
Lady Vyufmec... when you said 
you were called, do you mean...?

08:23.520 --> 08:25.330
You guessed it!

08:26.670 --> 08:31.560
Red here wants to talk with you 
and Illdoren, so he summoned me.

08:32.070 --> 08:34.990
That was a splendid blow you struck.

08:36.380 --> 08:39.000
Was that... the dragon talking?

08:39.520 --> 08:44.590
It has been many an age since anyone 
was able to do any harm to me.

08:44.590 --> 08:47.010
He's even got a distinct voice!

08:47.630 --> 08:49.620
You heard 'em, Red.

08:50.870 --> 08:52.710
We are all creatures of great will.

08:52.710 --> 08:56.900
How can it be strange that we're 
able to converse using it?

08:56.900 --> 09:00.040
Yeah, I'm with him on that one!

09:00.040 --> 09:02.550
I mean, my kin are just 
wind and water incarnate,

09:02.550 --> 09:04.990
and we can talk just fine...

09:04.990 --> 09:07.410
Red here's got a will of 
his own, like a person.

09:07.410 --> 09:09.650
Why wouldn't he be able to communicate?

09:09.650 --> 09:12.830
Though it's less talking,

09:12.830 --> 09:16.660
and more like me translating his dragon 
will, and then interpreting it as sound.

09:17.260 --> 09:19.380
I-I see...?

09:19.380 --> 09:22.670
For as long as I've known you, 
this is a true first.

09:22.950 --> 09:26.550
Well, I've tested you like I intended to.

09:26.550 --> 09:28.620
I'm returning home.

09:29.510 --> 09:33.680
What, already?! I thought 
we were gonna chat more!

09:33.680 --> 09:35.640
H-Hold it!

09:36.300 --> 09:39.680
Begging your pardon, fire dragon, 
but what do you mean by a test?

09:39.680 --> 09:41.460
You can't just attack
 us out of the blue,

09:41.460 --> 09:43.690
and then suddenly 
decide you're satisfied!

09:47.360 --> 09:48.530
Fair enough.

10:00.070 --> 10:03.220
Vessel of Orkfiem, and Illdoren...

10:03.590 --> 10:08.460
Having endured my test, you have proven 
yourselves worthy of speaking to.

10:11.560 --> 10:15.340
Though my wound does ache, 
so I intend on being brief.

10:15.340 --> 10:18.850
Uh... right. My apologies.

10:19.260 --> 10:21.230
Why apologize?

10:21.230 --> 10:25.080
I sought to test your power, 
which you demonstrated.

10:25.080 --> 10:29.480
This wound is that very proof. 
You should be proud.

10:31.760 --> 10:35.400
If I had intended on killing you,

10:35.400 --> 10:40.420
I would've endlessly rained 
flame upon you from upon high.

10:41.040 --> 10:43.490
And if I had no intent on testing you,

10:43.490 --> 10:47.070
why would I ever enter 
the range of your claws?

10:47.750 --> 10:50.420
A dragon just poked holes in my logic!

10:50.420 --> 10:53.170
No matter. On to the point.

10:55.620 --> 10:57.930
I tested you for a simple reason.

10:58.610 --> 11:04.430
Illdoren, after a long absence, 
has finally returned to our territory.

11:04.830 --> 11:08.640
As such, it is the custom of 
dragons to test one another,

11:08.640 --> 11:10.440
with fang, claw, and will.

11:10.440 --> 11:12.870
Illdoren... returned?

11:12.870 --> 11:16.070
In what way has my homeland returned here?

11:16.400 --> 11:18.000
Your homeland...?

11:19.140 --> 11:21.580
Then the name has fallen 
into the hands of a pack...

11:21.580 --> 11:24.830
I'm afraid there's little more 
I have to tell you, then.

11:26.680 --> 11:30.070
You're unlikely to remember 
much more until you've seen,

11:30.070 --> 11:33.250
heard, and felt more of 
these lands yourself.

11:34.520 --> 11:36.700
We're done talking.

11:36.700 --> 11:38.190
I am returning—

11:38.190 --> 11:42.600
Forgive me, but I would ask one 
last question of you! Please.

11:44.640 --> 11:48.850
What is it now, vessel of Orkfiem?

11:48.850 --> 11:53.520
Fire dragon, my people had no idea 
you true dragons were so wise

11:53.520 --> 11:56.110
and capable of exchanging will...

11:56.110 --> 12:01.620
Just the other day, the people of my 
village hunted a Morisuberi unto death.

12:01.990 --> 12:07.250
Having spoken with you, 
that now feels like a grave misdeed.

12:07.250 --> 12:10.750
Fire dragon, I would ask your 
judgment on the matter!

12:11.470 --> 12:14.980
Morisu...? What are you talking about?

12:14.980 --> 12:20.020
Red, red, those mori-things are the 
black ones. I've seen 'em before.

12:20.020 --> 12:23.260
Oh, he means the black ones, Vyufmec?

12:23.260 --> 12:27.520
One of their mighty number has 
been felled? I see, I see.

12:28.300 --> 12:30.370
Vessel of Orkfiem...

12:30.730 --> 12:35.180
The one you hunted was likely 
large and long-lived,

12:35.790 --> 12:40.320
ruling over the forests, using its 
amazing strength to tear its foes apart,

12:40.720 --> 12:43.780
with strength comparable to ours.

12:44.460 --> 12:49.790
If one so mighty was slain by 
ones as small as yourselves,

12:50.560 --> 12:52.360
it could only be because...

12:56.320 --> 12:57.800
It was senile.

13:01.900 --> 13:06.560
Senile as in... the loss of faculty 
that some experience with age?

13:07.380 --> 13:12.060
If you understand what I meant, 
then I'm certain that was the case.

13:15.430 --> 13:18.380
I don't understand your surprise.

13:18.700 --> 13:22.820
We are living creatures as well. 
We decline and grow ill, just like you.

13:23.640 --> 13:27.350
All life passes in time, much like 
all rainfall eventually ceases,

13:27.350 --> 13:30.020
and the sun must eventually set.

13:30.830 --> 13:35.530
The loss of faculty for those of 
us who have risen up by our will

13:35.530 --> 13:37.730
is an acceptance of a gradual death.

13:38.280 --> 13:42.590
And in our fading years, 
we are defeated, killed,

13:42.590 --> 13:44.930
and serve as sustenance for new life.

13:45.420 --> 13:49.850
I see no reason to deny that natural law.

13:50.510 --> 13:51.900
Natural law...

13:52.350 --> 13:54.870
Indeed. Natural law.

13:54.870 --> 13:58.800
You suggest treating us differently 
because we can communicate...

13:58.800 --> 14:02.510
but we, you, the beasts, the plants,

14:02.510 --> 14:05.870
all are equal lives 
in the face of natural law.

14:05.870 --> 14:11.100
Natural law is the great flow of life 
itself, stretching through all of time.

14:11.100 --> 14:15.180
And if all who live make up 
a portion of its waters,

14:15.180 --> 14:19.360
as long as it remains unadulterated, 
we dwell within natural law.

14:19.880 --> 14:24.270
Besides, had you failed my test,

14:24.270 --> 14:28.380
I would've devoured you and all 
the smaller folk around you.

14:28.380 --> 14:32.390
You need feel no restraint when 
dealing with me or the black ones.

14:33.220 --> 14:37.620
A-As eloquent as he is, the logic 
undermining it all is so... bestial.

14:37.620 --> 14:40.150
Granted, he is a beast...

14:40.470 --> 14:44.300
I take it I've answered 
your questions, then?

14:44.300 --> 14:48.280
Well, it had better be. 
I wish to return home.

14:48.280 --> 14:51.720
My hand hurts far more than I would 
like. I will go back and sleep.

14:56.660 --> 15:00.530
Orkfiem's vessel and Illdoren...

15:00.530 --> 15:05.880
If the mood strikes me, once I've 
healed, I may pay you a visit.

15:07.550 --> 15:09.930
I'm not sure that's a good idea...

15:11.210 --> 15:12.560
It was a joke.

15:13.430 --> 15:18.440
Farewell, vessel of Orkfiem and Illdoren!

15:18.440 --> 15:23.490
When we next meet, I hope you'll 
have an offspring to show me.

15:24.740 --> 15:26.140
Ow!

15:26.540 --> 15:29.220
I think I might cry...

15:30.730 --> 15:34.180
Bye-bye! And I'm out, too!

15:37.710 --> 15:41.440
True dragons are more 
garrulous than I expected.

15:41.440 --> 15:45.480
I had no idea the Guren Nairi could talk.

15:45.970 --> 15:50.370
And what did he mean about 
an offspring at the end?

15:50.370 --> 15:55.030
As long as it remains unadulterated, 
all life dwells within natural law...

15:55.030 --> 15:56.750
What is it, Veor?

15:56.750 --> 16:00.590
I was just pondering how, 
should we have a child,

16:00.590 --> 16:03.230
that would be another 
part of the flow of life.

16:06.670 --> 16:09.090
We have done nothing 
to conceive a child yet!

16:09.090 --> 16:10.710
Don't get ahead of yourself, fool!

16:10.710 --> 16:13.220
R-Right you are. Forgive me.

16:13.220 --> 16:17.020
We... We certainly have not yet, no.

16:17.850 --> 16:20.580
Why are you acting embarrassed, now?!

16:20.580 --> 16:23.180
Master Veor!

16:21.030 --> 16:23.180
Lady Serafina!

16:23.960 --> 16:26.970
Lady Serafina! I'm so glad you're alive!

16:26.970 --> 16:28.740
You're not hurt, are you?

16:28.740 --> 16:31.590
Malcius! I'm sorry to have worried you.

16:33.240 --> 16:36.960
I was so very seriously worried!

16:36.960 --> 16:38.350
Understandably so.

16:38.350 --> 16:39.930
It seems we were spared

16:39.930 --> 16:42.630
thanks to the fire dragon being 
reasonable, in its own way.

16:42.630 --> 16:45.610
Though if he was an ordinary beast, 
we would've likely won without a struggle.

16:45.860 --> 16:50.020
You could've also been seriously hurt 
if the dragon had felt like it!

16:56.410 --> 16:58.460
They spoke with the Guren Nairi!

16:58.460 --> 17:00.620
Cornem warriors are amazing!

17:00.620 --> 17:03.630
How much willpower do you 
need to cut a dragon?!

17:03.630 --> 17:07.430
Crystal Helmet, can we keep 
the Guren Nairi's digit?!

17:07.430 --> 17:10.380
What a day! We need to celebrate!

17:13.100 --> 17:15.100
I have to say...

17:16.140 --> 17:21.320
Given everything that happened on this 
journey, I'm glad no one was lost.

17:27.270 --> 17:29.180
Now then, Kimaki...

17:29.180 --> 17:32.360
your mobile furnace, your tools, 
your compressed fuel...

17:32.360 --> 17:35.410
along with slabs of 
True Silver for repairs.

17:35.410 --> 17:38.480
Remember to channel willpower 
through both your tools

17:38.480 --> 17:40.660
and the True Silver when you 
work, like I taught you.

17:41.240 --> 17:43.670
I will, Grandpa.

17:44.410 --> 17:46.170
You know, my dear Kimaki...

17:47.420 --> 17:50.680
Our people live a long time,

17:50.680 --> 17:53.680
but even I, who've been around 
for two centuries and change,

17:53.680 --> 17:56.930
had no idea that fire dragons could speak.

17:57.710 --> 17:59.930
The Thundering Voice and 
the Crystal Helmet...

18:00.390 --> 18:04.440
I'm sure that, if you follow them, 
you're bound to see amazing things.

18:04.750 --> 18:08.940
Work hard, and never forget the 
pride of your people, Kimaki.

18:09.210 --> 18:12.720
May good fortune and curiosity 
light the furnace of your heart...

18:12.720 --> 18:15.310
So that the flame will never go out.

18:19.040 --> 18:22.710
Your friends look ready to go, as well.

18:22.710 --> 18:27.220
Go on, Kimaki, my sweet grandchild.

18:27.220 --> 18:28.080
Okay...

18:29.560 --> 18:32.780
I'm off, Grandpa!

18:32.780 --> 18:37.320
Next time I see you, we'll share 
stories of what I've seen over drinks!

18:37.320 --> 18:38.830
Be seeing you!

18:38.830 --> 18:40.850
Take care!

18:40.850 --> 18:44.060
Are you done with your goodbyes, Kimaki?

18:44.060 --> 18:48.230
Sure am. It's not like I'm 
never coming back, after all.

18:48.230 --> 18:50.360
I'll need to pick up 
supplies from time to time.

18:50.360 --> 18:53.200
Looks like we're all ready.

18:53.200 --> 18:54.780
Off we go, then.

19:14.380 --> 19:16.020
We're flying!

19:19.290 --> 19:23.560
It's now been over a month since 
I started living in the east.

19:24.040 --> 19:28.420
It's been such a short time, 
but so much has happened.

19:28.960 --> 19:30.320
All of it has been so strange,

19:30.320 --> 19:32.960
defying what seemed like 
common sense in the west...

19:33.370 --> 19:38.660
Maybe if I convey what I've seen well, 
it can lead to a future without fighting.

19:39.690 --> 19:40.860
Veor...

19:40.860 --> 19:42.360
What is it, Sera?

19:42.900 --> 19:47.180
I've thought a great deal, and have come 
to a conclusion I believe is right.

19:47.670 --> 19:52.180
I've expanded my horizons, 
and realized what I want...

19:48.120 --> 19:50.710
Translation: Lee Francis

Timing: Andy Ellis

Editing: Zachary Carlysle

Quality Control: Salem Alabanza

Translation Check: Sho Stifler

19:53.460 --> 19:55.330
It's to put an end to my expedition,

19:55.330 --> 19:57.760
which began from a prejudiced 
point of view...

19:57.760 --> 19:59.200
I want to convey to my people

19:59.200 --> 20:03.180
that exchange will be far more 
productive than conquest.

20:03.180 --> 20:04.890
I see.

20:06.060 --> 20:11.370
And... I will officially resign 
from my post as a knight...

20:11.370 --> 20:13.570
After which... I will... marry you.

20:14.940 --> 20:16.570
I see!

20:16.570 --> 20:21.320
That's... a conclusion that 
I couldn't be happier about!

20:24.980 --> 20:26.200
Is something funny?

20:26.780 --> 20:28.320
It's just...

20:30.410 --> 20:34.810
I'm just a bit surprised about... 
how much I seem to...

20:34.810 --> 20:36.710
love you.

20:39.780 --> 20:41.220
Sera...!

20:41.720 --> 20:45.420
Please don't look at me like 
that while saying such things.

20:45.420 --> 20:48.690
Or do you enjoy testing my self-control?

20:49.950 --> 20:51.650
That wasn't my intent...

20:51.990 --> 20:53.350
entirely.

20:53.350 --> 20:54.620
Sera!

21:10.290 --> 21:18.760
m 10 0 l 210 0 l 220 10 l 220 65 l 210 75 l 210 75 l 10 75 l 0 65 l 0 10

21:10.290 --> 21:18.760
Kingdom of Illdoren
Royal Capital of Le d'Illdoren

21:12.000 --> 21:18.140
This now concludes my final report 
on the 17th Expedition.

21:19.050 --> 21:22.720
Margrave Sidius Lavillant...

21:23.150 --> 21:25.300
You have my thanks for your 
report on the expedition.

21:26.010 --> 21:26.760
Guards?

21:26.990 --> 21:27.690
Sir!

21:27.690 --> 21:28.990
Give us some privacy.

21:29.300 --> 21:32.600
I wish to discuss personal 
matters with Margrave Lavillant.

21:45.070 --> 21:46.440
I ask you...

21:48.550 --> 21:52.460
Why was the expedition recalled when 
we still had strength to spare?

21:49.830 --> 21:53.040
m 10 0 l 210 0 l 220 10 l 220 85 l 210 95 l 210 95 l 10 95 l 0 85 l 0 10

21:49.830 --> 21:53.040
King of Illdoren
Ouisselbreaux
d'Illdoren

21:53.040 --> 21:54.990
Begging your pardon, my king...

21:54.990 --> 21:59.380
Launching the 17th expedition a mere 
thirteen years after the 16th...

21:59.380 --> 22:03.250
Such a short interval leaves the 
people with little time to recover.

22:03.640 --> 22:05.610
And what of it?

22:06.730 --> 22:08.540
You should know better than to believe

22:08.540 --> 22:10.490
this campaign is meant
 to serve the people.

22:11.750 --> 22:15.090
My orders for you have always 
been the same, Lavillant...

22:16.350 --> 22:21.070
To seek out the barbarians who stole 
my beloved sister, Wysteresia,

22:21.370 --> 22:25.570
and tear them out by the roots! 
That is your family's duty!

22:26.320 --> 22:30.680
I even named your sister a 
knight commander, to that end...

22:30.680 --> 22:33.500
But it seems, for all her strength 
of arms, she's still a woman.

22:33.500 --> 22:37.590
Dying without accomplishing her mission, 
may she be shamed in death.

22:38.330 --> 22:42.440
It is nearly time for the harvest, 
so I will grant you this short reprieve.

22:42.440 --> 22:44.560
You are to re-organize the military

22:44.560 --> 22:47.220
and begin the 18th 
expedition by next spring.

22:49.340 --> 22:51.570
This, I command.

22:57.820 --> 23:02.110
Are you still entranced by the 
spectre of the dead, my king?

23:02.330 --> 23:05.010
Because of your fixation 
on your late sister,

23:05.010 --> 23:07.620
the expeditions... and my sister...

23:09.740 --> 23:11.680
Regardless of my own desires,

23:12.190 --> 23:15.180
I must attend to the 
duty assigned to my house.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.720
Ours has served 
the country since its founding.

23:17.720 --> 23:21.980
As head of the Lavillants, as I must 
serve as the royal family's blade.

23:22.700 --> 23:25.230
That will have to suffice, for now.

23:27.980 --> 23:31.890
The Eastern Expeditions will 
end with my generation.

23:32.680 --> 23:36.670
I will exterminate the barbarians!
